{"version":1,"key":"quest:204","content":{"id":204,"title":"canvas.captureStream() 的作用和使用场景！","summary":"暂未记录答案","target":{"key":"quest:204","type":"quest","id":204},"groupId":2,"groupTitle":"前端","groupColor":"mint-green","status":"resolved","answers":[],"materials":[{"index":1,"kind":"card","group":"note","title":"canvas captureStream 捕获内容为媒体流","meta":"","excerpt":"canvas.captureStream(fps?: number) 支持将 canvas 上渲染的内容捕获为一个 MediaStream 对象，其中包含一个视频轨道。 fps 参数用来指定捕获的帧率： 如果传 0 的话则表示只在内容变化时才捕获新帧（需要手动调用 stream.getVideoTracks()[0].","target":{"key":"card:766","type":"card","id":766},"citeKey":"card:766"}],"trail":[{"time":1781055624790,"tone":"start","text":"提出问题","refs":[]},{"time":1782436554325,"tone":"milestone","text":"写下卡片","refs":[1]},{"time":1782437749166,"tone":"done","text":"标为已解决","refs":[]}],"description":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}],"createTime":1781055624790,"updateTime":1781055624790,"resolvedTime":1782437749166},"meta":{"type":"quest","publishTime":1781055624790}}